nd="00:45.190"><span begin="00:43.240" end="00:43.480">So </span><span begin="00:43.480" end="00:43.780">go </span><span begin="00:43.780" end="00:44.260">ahead </span><span begin="00:44.260" end="00:44.530">girl </span><span begin="00:44.530" end="00:44.860">just </span><span begin="00:44.860" end="00:45.190">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.700" end="00:47.470"><span begin="00:45.700" end="00:46.000">That </span><span begin="00:46.000" end="00:46.150">ass </span><span begin="00:46.150" end="00:46.630">shaking </span><span begin="00:46.630" end="00:46.960">thing </span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.230">you </span><span begin="00:47.230" end="00:47.470">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.470" end="00:48.820"><span begin="00:47.470" end="00:47.620">So </span><span begin="00:47.620" end="00:47.800">you </span><span begin="00:47.800" end="00:48.190">grab </span><span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.280">your </span><span begin="00:48.280" end="00:48.820">girls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.820" end="00:49.930"><span begin="00:48.820" end="00:48.910">And </span><span begin="00:48.910" end="00:49.000">you </span><span begin="00:49.000" end="00:49.240">grab </span><span begin="00:49.240" end="00:49.300">a </span><span begin="00:49.300" end="00:49.600">couple </span><span begin="00:49.600" end="00:49.930">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.930" end="00:51.130"><span begin="00:49.930" end="00:50.110">And </span><span begin="00:50.110" end="00:50.230">you </span><span begin="00:50.230" end="00:50.470">all </span><span begin="00:50.470" end="00:50.680">come </span><span begin="00:50.680" end="00:50.950">meet </span><span begin="00:50.950" end="00:51.130">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.130" end="00:52.210"><span begin="00:51.130" end="00:51.280">In </span><span begin="00:51.280" end="00:51.370">the </span><span begin="00:51.370" end="00:51.730">middle </span><span begin="00:51.730" end="00:51.880">of </span><span begin=